@slavic18 - Can you provide logging for the errors you see? there is some warnings about missing Google OAuth configs (client_id, secret, etc), which can be ignored. other than that, there is not supposed to be any required credential for supabase. if so, it must be a bug.

let us know what you see and we can fix it ASAP.

BTW, we are also working on an installation package for production build to have all the dependencies bundled in. i will update this issue as we merge it.
